    "body": "P8 effort:max area:multiaxis - triage.\nThis is an accepted enhancement, not a defect: a surface-based workflow needs design and research before code.\nThe report names two needs. Both have open tracks:\n- STEP B-rep and NURBS surfaces kept beside the mesh: the solidcore programme (#27) and the spline-face deviation bound (#1029).\n- Lollipop and other form cutters: #896. Native CAD and Rhino files: #1572.\neffort:max - the work needs a new geometry representation and new tool-contact algorithms.\nReporter: woodwindnerd, 2026-11-15. Use case: saxophone mouthpieces, freeform chambers and undercuts, simultaneous 5-axis.\n",
